			"notes": "Adds liquid lava support for generator furnaces through NeoForge fluid capabilities, so modpack tanks and pipes can feed lava directly. Lava is consumed in 1 bucket amounts and generates the same energy as a lava bucket in normal generator mode. Also fixes lava bucket fuel consumption so the empty bucket is returned instead of being voided. Built and validated with ./gradlew.bat build. SHA256: 0912D51EBA498B64F43449019B32CEAE09C169431A843FCFF1C60B5C1DFAD238."
